@* The reader's own status, beside the publication status the sources supply. They are
   two separate fields in the model and two separate readings of the same series
   (CLAUDE.md — Series status vs Publication status), so the hero states both rather
   than blending them into one word.

   The segmented control, not a dropdown: four choices, always laid out, one press each.
   Its buttons carry aria-pressed, so the current status is announced. *@

<SegmentedControl TValue="TrackingStatus"
                  Options="StatusOptions"
                  Value="Series.TrackingStatus"
                  ValueChanged="OnChosenAsync"
                  Disabled="SeriesState.IsSaving"
                  AriaLabel="Your status" />
